nslate-y-4 transition-all duration-300" src="/images/hierarchy.svg" alt="hierarchy"/><img class="w-8 h-auto translate-y-4 group-hover:-translate-y-4 transition-all duration-300" src="/images/hierarchy.svg" alt="hierarchy"/></div><div class="text-font-32 font-normal tracking-tight mt-4.5">150 Million</div><div class="space-y-1.5 mt-1"><p class="text-font-16">Ethically sourced proxies</p></div></div><div class="card__outline p-6 pl-4 md:py-[3.0625rem] md:px-8 h-auto flex-1 lg:flex-none hover:bg-white transition-all duration-300 group"><div class="w-8 h-8 overflow-hidden flex items-center justify-center flex-col"><img class="w-8 h-auto translate-y-4 group-hover:-translate-y-4 transition-all duration-300" src="/images/trello.svg" alt="trello"/><img class="w-8 h-auto translate-y-4 group-hover:-translate-y-4 transition-all duration-300" src="/images/trello.svg" alt="trello"/></div><div class="text-font-32 font-normal tracking-tight mt-4.5">+40%</div><div class="space-y-1.5 mt-2.5"><p class="text-font-16">Faster gateway than the closest competitor.</p></div></div></div></div></div></section><section class="mt-8 md:mt-16"><div class="wrapper"><ul class="flex items-center justify-center gap-4 md:gap-6 lg:gap-8"><li><a href="https://www.trustpilot.com/review/scrape.do" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer"><img class="w-21 md:w-28 h-auto" src="/images/hero-client-1.svg" alt="Trustpilot Reviews"/></a></li><li><a href="https://www.g2.com/products/scrape-do/reviews" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer"><img class="w-32 md:w-42.5 h-auto" src="/images/hero-client-2.svg" alt="G2 Reviews"/></a></li><li><a href="https://www.capterra.com/p/245777/Scrapedo/" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer"><img class="w-23.5 md:w-31 h-auto" src="/images/hero-client-3.svg" alt="Capterra Reviews"/></a></li></ul><ul class="flex items-center justify-center flex-wrap max-sm:gap-x-1 gap-6 lg:gap-8 mt-6 md:mt-8 px-6"><li><img src="/images/capterra-most-recommended.svg" alt="scrapedo capterra most recommended" class="w-20.5 md:w-23 h-16 md:h-18"/></li><li><img src="/images/capterra-best-ease-of-use.svg" alt="scrapedo capterra best ease of use" class="w-20.5 md:w-23 h-16 md:h-18"/></li><li><img src="/images/capterra-best-value.png" alt="scrapedo capterra best value" class="w-20.5 md:w-23 h-16 md:h-18"/></li><li><img src="/images/capterra-best-customer-support.svg" alt="capterra best customer support" class="w-20.5 md:w-23 h-16 md:h-18"/></li><li><img src="/images/capterra-front-runners.png" alt="scrapedo capterra front runners" class="w-20.5 md:w-23 h-16 md:h-18"/></li></ul></div></section><section id="faq" class="md:pt-7 pb-20 md:pb-[10.75rem] bg-custom-white-400 rounded-[2rem] md:rounded-[3.5rem] relative -bottom-18"><script type="application/ld+json">{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"FAQPage","mainEntity":[{"@type":"Question","name":"How do you only charge for successful API calls?","acceptedAnswer":{"@type":"Answer","text":"\u003cp>You&#39;re only charged when a request returns a successful response with valid content. You won&#39;t lose credits on timeouts, blocks, or errors. Even if you get a 200 OK response but the response content is not valid, you can reach out to our support to claim your used credits.\u003c/p>\n"}},{"@type":"Question","name":"What features are included in the free plan?","acceptedAnswer":{"@type":"Answer","text":"\u003cp>The free plan includes 1,000 successful API calls per month with full access to residential and mobile proxies, geo-targeting, CAPTCHA handling, JavaScript rendering, and more—no credit card required.\u003c/p>\n"}},{"@type":"Question","name":"Can I cancel anytime?","acceptedAnswer":{"@type":"Answer","text":"\u003cp>Yes, there are no long-term commitments. Cancel, downgrade, or upgrade your plan whenever you need.\u003c/p>\n"}},{"@type":"Question","name":"What payment methods do you accept?","acceptedAnswer":{"@type":"Answer","text":"\u003cp>You can pay your Scrape.do subscription using credit card, with crypto, or through a bank wire transfer for monthly payments over $500.\u003c/p>\n"}},{"@type":"Question","name":"What happens when I use up my monthly credits?","acceptedAnswer":{"@type":"Answer","text":"\u003cp>We will contact you when it seems like your credits won&#39;t last for this month, and once you hit your monthly limit, requests will stop unless you upgrade your plan or purchase additional credits.\u003c/p>\n"}},{"@type":"Question","name":"Is there a discount for annual billing?","acceptedAnswer":{"@type":"Answer","text":"\u003cp>Yes. Annual billing gives you up to 20% off—pay for 10 months and get 12—on every plan except Enterprise. Hobby is $290/year instead of $29/month, Pro is $990/year instead of $99/month, Business is $2,490/year instead of $249/month, and Advanced is $6,990/year instead of $699/month. This is currently set up manually, so reach out to us via chat or email \u003ca href=\"mailto:support@scrape.do\">support@scrape.do\u003c/a> to switch to annual billing.\u003c/p>\n"}},{"@type":"Question","name":"Do you offer custom plans for unique scraping needs?","acceptedAnswer":{"@type":"Answer","text":"\u003cp>Yes. Our Custom and Enterprise plans are built around your volume, concurrency, support, and infrastructure needs; tailored specifically for your use case.\u003c/p>\n"}},{"@type":"Question","name":"How many requests can you handle?","acceptedAnswer":{"@type":"Answer","text":"\u003cp>Scrape.do processes billions of requests per month and can scale from 10 to 1 billion+ requests, instantly.\u003c/p>\n"}},{"@type":"Question","name":"Do I get hands-on support, or just ticket-based help?","acceptedAnswer":{"@type":"Answer","text":"\u003cp>All paid plans include real developer support; no bots, no tickets. Business and Enterprise plans also come with a dedicated account manager and priority response.\u003c/p>\n"}}]}</script><div class="wrapper"><div class="w-full max-w-3/4 mx-auto flex flex-col lg:flex-row lg:items-start gap-10 lg:gap-[7.375rem]"><div class="w-full max-w-2/5"><p class="text-font-16 text-custom-gray-500">F.A.Q</p><h2 class="text-font-40 tracking-tight mt-1 md:mt-3">Frequently Asked Questions.</h2><p class="text-font-16 font-normal max-w-[18.75rem] mt-2 md:mt-4">Get answers to commonly asked questions.</p></div><div class="flex-1"><div class="custom__accordion custom__accordion--faq"><div class="accordion__item"><button class="accordion__button" type="button"><h3 class="text-font-16 font-normal">How do you only charge for successful API calls?</h3><div class="accordion__icon"><img class="accordion__icon-plus" src="/images/faq-plus.svg" alt="plus"/><img class="accordion__icon-minus" src="/images/faq-minus.svg" alt="minus"/></div></button><div class="accordion__content"><div class="space-y-4 pt-3 pb-2 faq-content"><p>You&#39;re only charged when a request returns a successful response with valid content. You won&#39;t lose credits on timeouts, blocks, or errors. Even if you get a 200 OK response but the response content is not valid, you can reach out to our support to claim your used credits.</p>
</div></div></div><div class="accordion__item"><button class="accordion__button" type="button"><h3 class="text-font-16 font-normal">What features are included in the free plan?</h3><div class="accordion__icon"><img class="accordion__icon-plus" src="/images/faq-plus.svg" alt="plus"/><img class="accordion__icon-minus" src="/images/faq-minus.svg" alt="minus"/></div></button><div class="accordion__content"><div class="space-y-4 pt-3 pb-2 faq-content"><p>The free plan includes 1,000 successful API calls per month with full access to residential and mobile proxies, geo-targeting, CAPTCHA handling, JavaScript rendering, and more—no credit card required.</p>
</div></div></div><div class="accordion__item"><button class="accordion__button" type="button"><h3 class="text-font-16 font-normal">Can I cancel anytime?</h3><div class="accordion__icon"><img class="accordion__icon-plus" src="/images/faq-plus.svg" alt="plus"/><img class="accordion__icon-minus" src="/images/faq-minus.svg" alt="minus"/></div></button><div class="accordion__content"><div class="space-y-4 pt-3 pb-2 faq-content"><p>Yes, there are no long-term commitments. Cancel, downgrade, or upgrade your plan whenever you need.</p>
</div></div></div><div class="accordion__item"><button class="accordion__button" type="button"><h3 class="text-font-16 font-normal">What payment methods do you accept?</h3><div class="accordion__icon"><img class="accordion__icon-plus" src="/images/faq-plus.svg" alt="plus"/><img class="accordion__icon-minus" src="/images/faq-minus.svg" alt="minus"/></div></button><div class="accordion__content"><div class="space-y-4 pt-3 pb-2 faq-content"><p>You can pay your Scrape.do subscription using credit card, with crypto, or through a bank wire transfer for monthly payments over $500.</p>
</div></div></div><div class="accordion__item"><button class="accordion__button" type="button"><h3 class="text-font-16 font-normal">What happens when I use up my monthly credits?</h3><div class="accordion__icon"><img class="accordion__icon-plus" src="/images/faq-plus.svg" alt="plus"/><img class="accordion__icon-minus" src="/images/faq-minus.svg" alt="minus"/></div></button><div class="accordion__content"><div class="space-y-4 pt-3 pb-2 faq-content"><p>We will contact you when it seems like your credits won&#39;t last for this month, and once you hit your monthly limit, requests will stop unless you upgrade your plan or purchase additional credits.</p>
</div></div></div><div class="accordion__item"><button class="accordion__button" type="button"><h3 class="text-font-16 font-normal">Is there a discount for annual billing?</h3><div class="accordion__icon"><img class="accordion__icon-plus" src="/images/faq-plus.svg" alt="plus"/><img class="accordion__icon-minus" src="/images/faq-minus.svg" alt="minus"/></div></button><div class="accordion__content"><div class="space-y-4 pt-3 pb-2 faq-content"><p>Yes. Annual billing gives you up to 20% off—pay for 10 months and get 12—on every plan except Enterprise. Hobby is $290/year instead of $29/month, Pro is $990/year instead of $99/month, Business is $2,490/year instead of $249/month, and Advanced is $6,990/year instead of $699/month. This is currently set up manually, so reach out to us via chat or email <a href="mailto:support@scrape.do">support@scrape.do</a> to switch to annual billing.</p>
</div></div></div><div class="accordion__item"><button class="accordion__button" type="button"><h3 class="text-font-16 font-normal">Do you offer custom plans for unique scraping needs?</h3><div class="accordion__icon"><img class="accordion__icon-plus" src="/images/faq-plus.svg" alt="plus"/><img class="accordion__icon-minus" src="/images/faq-minus.svg" alt="minus"/></div></button><div class="accordion__content"><div class="space-y-4 pt-3 pb-2 faq-content"><p>Yes. Our Custom and Enterprise plans are built around your volume, concurrency, support, and infrastructure needs; tailored specifically for your use case.</p>
</div></div></div><div class="accordion__item"><button class="accordion__button" type="button"><h3 class="text-font-16 font-normal">How many requests can you handle?</h3><div class="accordion__icon"><img class="accordion__icon-plus" src="/images/faq-plus.svg" alt="plus"/><img class="accordion__icon-minus" src="/images/faq-minus.svg" alt="minus"/></div></button><div class="accordion__content"><div class="space-y-4 pt-3 pb-2 faq-content"><p>Scrape.do processes billions of requests per month and can scale from 10 to 1 billion+ requests, instantly.</p>
</div></div></div><div class="accordion__item"><button class="accordion__button" type="button"><h3 class="text-font-16 font-normal">Do I get hands-on support, or just ticket-based help?</h3><div class="accordion__icon"><img class="accordion__icon-plus" src="/images/faq-plus.svg" alt="plus"/><img class="accordion__icon-minus" src="/images/faq-minus.svg" alt="minus"/></div></button><div class="accordion__content"><div class="space-y-4 pt-3 pb-2 faq-content"><p>All paid plans include real developer support; no bots, no tickets. Business and Enterprise plans also come with a dedicated account manager and priority response.</p>
</div></div></div></div></div></div></div></section><!--$--><!--/$--></main><footer class="pt-[7.5rem] md:pt-[10.625rem] pb-12 md:pb-14.5 bg-custom-black"><div class="wrapper"><div class="flex flex-col xl:flex-row"><div class="flex-1 border-l border-custom-gray-100/20 first-of-type:border-l-0 xl:px-6 xl:first-of-type:pl-0"><div class="flex items-center justify-between xl:justify-start gap-8"><a class="w-16" href="/"><img src="/images/footer-logo.svg" alt="footer logo"/></a><ul class="flex items-center gap-2.5"><li><a href="https://www.linkedin.com/company/scrape-do/" class="w-10 h-10 bg-custom-white rounded-full flex items-center justify-center" rel="noopener noreferer"><img class="w-5" src="/images/linkedin-dark.svg" alt="linkedin"/></a></li></ul></div><div class="custom__accordion custom__accordion--common custom__accordion--footer mt-12 xl:hidden"><div class="accordion__item"><button class="accordion__button text-custom-white" type="button"><span class="text-font-16 font-normal">Company</span><div class="accordion__icon"><img src="/images/accordion-arrow.svg" alt="arrow"/></div></button><div class="accordion__content"><div class="space-y-4 pt-4"><ul class="space-y-3.5"><li><a href="/documentation/contact/" class="text-custom-white/50 hover:underline">Contact Us</a></li><li><a href="/documentation/changelog/" class="text-custom-white/50 hover:underline">Changelog</a></li><li><a href="https://scrapedoreviews.com/" class="text-custom-white/50 hover:underline">Reviews</a></li><li><a href="/terms-of-use/" class="text-custom-white/50 hover:underline">Terms of Use</a></li><li><a href="/privacy-policy/" class="text-custom-white/50 hover:underline">Privacy Policy</a></li><li><a href="/affiliate/" class="text-custom-white/50 hover:underline">Affiliate Program</a></li></ul></div></div></div><div class="accordion__item"><button class="accordion__button text-custom-white" type="button"><span class="text-font-16 font-normal">Scrape Google</span><div class="accordion__icon"><im