ition-all duration-300\",\"src\":\"/images/trello.svg\",\"alt\":\"trello\"}]]}],[\"$\",\"div\",null,{\"className\":\"text-font-32 font-normal tracking-tight mt-4.5\",\"children\":\"+40%\"}],[\"$\",\"div\",null,{\"className\":\"space-y-1.5 mt-2.5\",\"children\":[\"$\",\"p\",null,{\"className\":\"text-font-16\",\"children\":\"Faster gateway than the closest competitor.\"}]}]]}]]}]\n"])</script><script>self.__next_f.push([1,"13f:[\"$\",\"div\",null,{\"className\":\"wrapper\",\"children\":[\"$\",\"div\",null,{\"className\":\"w-full max-w-3/4 mx-auto flex flex-col lg:flex-row lg:items-start gap-10 lg:gap-[7.375rem]\",\"children\":[[\"$\",\"div\",null,{\"className\":\"w-full max-w-2/5\",\"children\":[[\"$\",\"p\",null,{\"className\":\"text-font-16 text-custom-gray-500\",\"children\":\"F.A.Q\"}],[\"$\",\"h2\",null,{\"className\":\"text-font-40 tracking-tight mt-1 md:mt-3\",\"children\":\"Frequently Asked Questions.\"}],[\"$\",\"p\",null,{\"className\":\"text-font-16 font-normal max-w-[18.75rem] mt-2 md:mt-4\",\"children\":\"Get answers to commonly asked questions.\"}]]}],[\"$\",\"div\",null,{\"className\":\"flex-1\",\"children\":[[\"$\",\"$L144\",null,{\"faq\":[{\"question\":\"How do you only charge for successful API calls?\",\"answer\":\"\u003cp\u003eYou\u0026#39;re only charged when a request returns a successful response with valid content. You won\u0026#39;t lose credits on timeouts, blocks, or errors. Even if you get a 200 OK response but the response content is not valid, you can reach out to our support to claim your used credits.\u003c/p\u003e\\n\"},{\"question\":\"What features are included in the free plan?\",\"answer\":\"\u003cp\u003eThe free plan includes 1,000 successful API calls per month with full access to residential and mobile proxies, geo-targeting, CAPTCHA handling, JavaScript rendering, and more—no credit card required.\u003c/p\u003e\\n\"},{\"question\":\"Can I cancel anytime?\",\"answer\":\"\u003cp\u003eYes, there are no long-term commitments. Cancel, downgrade, or upgrade your plan whenever you need.\u003c/p\u003e\\n\"},{\"question\":\"What payment methods do you accept?\",\"answer\":\"\u003cp\u003eYou can pay your Scrape.do subscription using credit card, with crypto, or through a bank wire transfer for monthly payments over $500.\u003c/p\u003e\\n\"},{\"question\":\"What happens when I use up my monthly credits?\",\"answer\":\"\u003cp\u003eWe will contact you when it seems like your credits won\u0026#39;t last for this month, and once you hit your monthly limit, requests will stop unless you upgrade your plan or purchase additional credits.\u003c/p\u003e\\n\"},{\"question\":\"Is there a discount for annual billing?\",\"answer\":\"\u003cp\u003eYes. Annual billing gives you up to 20% off—pay for 10 months and get 12—on every plan except Enterprise. Hobby is $290/year instead of $29/month, Pro is $990/year instead of $99/month, Business is $2,490/year instead of $249/month, and Advanced is $6,990/year instead of $699/month. This is currently set up manually, so reach out to us via chat or email \u003ca href=\\\"mailto:support@scrape.do\\\"\u003esupport@scrape.do\u003c/a\u003e to switch to annual billing.\u003c/p\u003e\\n\"},{\"question\":\"Do you offer custom plans for unique scraping needs?\",\"answer\":\"\u003cp\u003eYes. Our Custom and Enterprise plans are built around your volume, concurrency, support, and infrastructure needs; tailored specifically for your use case.\u003c/p\u003e\\n\"},{\"question\":\"How many requests can you handle?\",\"answer\":\"\u003cp\u003eScrape.do processes billions of requests per month and can scale from 10 to 1 billion+ requests, instantly.\u003c/p\u003e\\n\"},{\"question\":\"Do I get hands-on support, or just ticket-based help?\",\"answer\":\"\u003cp\u003eAll paid plans include real developer support; no bots, no tickets. Business and Enterprise plans also come with a dedicated account manager and priority response.\u003c/p\u003e\\n\"}]}],\"$undefined\"]}]]}]}]\n"])</script><s